          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">140–141</td><td class="code-col"><span class="cmt">//IN for device0</span>
<span class="kw">for</span>(I =<span class="num">0</span>; I &lt; <span class="num">1</span>; I = I+<span class="num">1</span>)<span class="kw">begin</span></td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">外层循环</span>开始发送 Device 0 的完整配置帧，循环 <code>1</code> 次（方便后续修改上限以测试重复发包）。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">143</td><td class="code-col">@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay IN = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;RST = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">通信复位</span>在时钟上升沿同时拉低 <code>IN</code> 和 <code>RST</code>，清空被测芯片内部串行接收状态机。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">145</td><td class="code-col">@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay IN = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;RST = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">空闲态</span>下一个时钟上升沿释放复位（<code>RST=1</code>），并将数据线 <code>IN</code> 拉高至串行总线空闲（Idle）高电平。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">146</td><td class="code-col">#(10*clock);</td><td class="desc-col">保持空闲高电平 10 个时钟周期（<code>1000ns</code>），确保芯片完成复位退出准备。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">148</td><td class="code-col">	<span class="kw">for</span>(J =<span class="num">0</span>; J &lt; <span class="num">350</span>; J = J+<span class="num">10</span>)<span class="kw">begin</span></td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">字节发送循环</span><code>J</code> 从 <code>0</code> 开始每次加 <code>10</code>，共循环 <strong>35 次</strong>（<code>J = 0, 10, ..., 340</code>），逐字节发送全部 35 字节配置。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">149</td><td class="code-col">		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">起始位</span>在时钟上升沿拉低 <code>IN</code>，发送 <strong>1-bit 起始位（Start Bit = 0）</strong>，通知接收端开始采样。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">151–158</td><td class="code-col">		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J+<span class="num">1</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J+<span class="num">2</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J+<span class="num">3</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J+<span class="num">4</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J+<span class="num">5</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J+<span class="num">6</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = command[J+<span class="num">7</span>];</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">8位数据负载</span>在连续 8 个时钟上升沿，按照<strong>低位在前（LSB-first）</strong>顺序依次串行输出当前字节的 <code>bit[0]</code> 至 <code>bit[7]</code>。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">160</td><td class="code-col">		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">停止位</span>在时钟上升沿拉高 <code>IN</code>，发送 <strong>1-bit 停止位（Stop Bit = 1）</strong>，完成一个标准 10-bit 帧的传输。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">161</td><td class="code-col">	<span class="kw">end</span></td><td class="desc-col">结束单字节发送循环，进入下一个字节（<code>J + 10</code>）。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">163–167</td><td class="code-col">@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay IN = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;
#(10*clock);
@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay IN = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;
@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay IN = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;
#(10*clock);
<span class="kw">end</span></td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">包结束帧尾</span>35 字节发送完毕后，拉低 <code>IN</code> 保持 10 个周期，随后产生一个 1 周期宽的高电平脉冲（<code>1 -> 0</code>）作为配置帧结束/锁存标志，再等待 10 个周期后结束外层循环。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">169–222</td><td class="code-col"><span class="cmt">/*
//IN for device1 ...
//IN for device2 ...
*/</span></td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag cmt">多行注释</span>被屏蔽的 Device 1 与 Device 2 串行发送代码块，结构与 Device 0 完全相同；由于当前是单设备（<code>single</code>）测试平台，故将其注释关闭。</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 5 -->
  <section class="section-card" id="sec-5">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>5. 启动执行指令与曼彻斯特编码输出</h2>
      <span class="line-range">Lines 224 – 247</span>
    </div>
    <div class="code-table-wrap">
      <table class="code-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>行号</th><th>Verilog 代码</th><th>逐行功能解析</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">224–226</td><td class="code-col"><span class="cmt">//operation command</span>
@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay IN = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;RST = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;
#(10*clock);</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">启动指令前奏</span>拉低 <code>RST</code> 复位接口接收逻辑（保持 <code>IN=1</code>），持续 10 个时钟周期（<code>1000ns</code>）。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">227</td><td class="code-col">@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;RST = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">启动帧起始位</span>在时钟上升沿释放复位（<code>RST=1</code>），同时将 <code>IN</code> 拉低作为启动命令帧的 <strong>Start Bit (0)</strong>。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">229–236</td><td class="code-col">		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">0</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">1</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">2</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">3</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">4</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">5</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">6</span>];
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = address[<span class="num">7</span>];</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">发送目标地址</span>在连续 8 个时钟上升沿逐位发送 <code>address</code>（<code>8'b1111_1111</code> 广播地址），寻址总线上所有待触发设备。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">238–239</td><td class="code-col">		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">停止位与间隔</span>先发送 1 位停止位（<code>1</code>），再拉低 <code>IN</code>（<code>0</code>）准备发送触发脉冲。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">241–242</td><td class="code-col">		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = <span class="num">1'b1</span>;<span class="cmt">//operation start</span>
		@(<span class="kw">posedge</span> CLK) #delay; IN = <span class="num">1'b0</span>;</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">正式启动触发</span>产生一个 1 时钟周期宽的高电平脉冲（<code>1 -> 0</code>），命令芯片正式开始执行前面配置好的电刺激与光刺激脉冲序列！</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">244</td><td class="code-col"><span class="kw">end</span></td><td class="desc-col">结束 <code>initial</code> 激励过程块（注意：<code>always</code> 时钟块仍会继续运行，以便观察芯片后续输出波形）。</td></tr>
          <tr class="code-row"><td class="ln">246</td><td class="code-col"><span class="kw">assign</span> MAN = (CLK <span class="kw">^|</span> IN);</td><td class="desc-col"><span class="tag">曼彻斯特编码</span>使用按位同或运算符（<code>^|</code>，等价于 <code>~(CLK ^ IN)</code>）将时钟 <code>CLK</code> 与串行数据 <code>IN</code> 合成为单线<strong>曼彻斯特编码（Manchester Code）</strong>：当 <code>IN=1</code> 时 <code>MAN = CLK</code>（下降沿跳变）；当 <code>IN=0</code> 时 <code>MAN = ~CLK</code>（上升沿跳变）。这使得植入式脑机接口芯片仅需一根线即可同时恢复时钟与数据。</td></tr>
